### Retraining Workflow

#### Phase 1: Data Collection (2 weeks)
1. Collect 500+ new vehicle damage images
2. Annotate images with bounding boxes (5 classes)
3. Use YOLO label format
4. Split: 70% train, 15% val, 15% test

#### Phase 2: Data Preparation (1 day)
```bash
cd preprocessing

# Clean and organize new data
python dataset_cleaner.py --input ../datasets/new_data --output ../datasets/dataset_combined

# Verify data
python dataset_analysis.py --input ../datasets/dataset_combined
```

#### Phase 3: Model Training (3-5 days)
```bash
cd training

# Main training script
python train_damage_detection_v1.py \
    --data ../datasets/dataset_combined/data.yaml \
    --epochs 100 \
    --batch 16 \
    --imgsz 416 \
    --device 0

# Or with Ultralytics directly
from ultralytics import YOLO

model = YOLO("yolov8n.pt")
results = model.train(
    data="../datasets/dataset_combined/data.yaml",
    epochs=100,
    batch=16,
    imgsz=416,
    device=0
)
```

#### Phase 4: Evaluation (2 days)
```bash
cd evaluation

# Comprehensive evaluation
python evaluate_model_comprehensive.py \
    --model ../models/best_damage_model.pt \
    --data ../datasets/dataset_combined \
    --confidence 0.25

# Generate metrics
python generate_metrics.py \
    --predictions output.json \
    --groundtruth labels
```

#### Phase 5: Deployment (1 day)
```bash
# Copy new model to integration package
cp models/runs/detect/train/weights/best.pt ../integration_package/best_damage_model.pt

# Update deployment
cd integration_package
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn inspection_api:app
```

